      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "‘Only A’ means in A but not in B.\n\nOnly A = n(A)-n(A∩B).\nOnly B = n(B)-n(A∩B).\n\nPlace the overlap first, then subtract it from each total.",
