      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "Some chapter questions turn group membership into a weighted total.\n\nIf each ride costs ₹1, total receipt equals total number of rides taken. Someone taking three rides contributes 3 to the receipt, someone taking one contributes 1.\n\nCount people and count memberships as two different totals.",
